ody-Keeps-Score-Healing/dp/0670785938?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.amazon.com/The-Body-Keeps-Score-Healing/dp/0670785938?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Bessel van der Kolk</author></item><item><title>3: THE ANXIOUS GENERATION</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780593655030.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A co-author of “The Coddling of the American Mind” looks at the mental health impacts that a phone-based life has on children.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;70 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Jonathan Haidt&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Penguin Press</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593655036?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593655036?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Jonathan Haidt</author></item><item><title>4: MY GOOD SIDE</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9781538773352.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The actress and star of the reality TV series “Vanderpump Rules” shares behind-the-scenes stories and struggles she experienced in her life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Scheana Shay&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Grand Central</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/153877335X?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/153877335X?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Scheana Shay</author></item><item><title>5: A MARRIAGE AT SEA</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780593854280.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;In 1972, an incident with a breaching whale turns a couple’s dream of sailing on a boat into a monthslong struggle for survival on a raft.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Sophie Elmhirst&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Riverhead</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593854284?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593854284?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Sophie Elmhirst</author></item><item><title>6: EVERYTHING IS TUBERCULOSIS</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780525556572.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The author of “The Anthropocene Reviewed” chronicles the fight against the deadly infectious disease tuberculosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;17 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by John Green&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Crash Course</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0525426051?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0525426051?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by John Green</author></item><item><title>7: MARK TWAIN</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780525561729.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Pulitzer Prize-winning biographer portrays the life and career of the literary celebrity and political pundit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;11 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Ron Chernow&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Penguin Press</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0525561722?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0525561722?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Ron Chernow</author></item><item><title>8: OUTLIVE</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780593236598.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A look at recent scientific research on aging and longevity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;96 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Peter Attia with Bill Gifford&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Harmony</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593236599?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593236599?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Peter Attia with Bill Gifford</author></item><item><title>9: ABUNDANCE</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9781668023488.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A New York Times opinion columnist and a staff writer at The Atlantic evaluate obstacles to American progress.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;19 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Ezra Klein and Derek Thompson&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Avid Reader</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/1668023482?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/1668023482?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Ezra Klein and Derek Thompson</author></item><item><title>10: SIGNS</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780399591617.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A medium details potential ways the deceased may speak to us through everyday events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Laura Lynne Jackson&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Dial</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/Signs-Language-Laura-Lynne-Jackson/dp/0399591591?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/Signs-Language-Laura-Lynne-Jackson/dp/0399591591?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><autho