er: Center Street</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/1546009140?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/1546009140?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Salena Zito</author></item><item><title>14: ON TYRANNY</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780804190114.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;Twenty lessons from the 20th century about the course of tyranny.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;60 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Timothy Snyder&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Crown</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/Tyranny-Twenty-Lessons-Twentieth-Century/dp/0804190119?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/Tyranny-Twenty-Lessons-Twentieth-Century/dp/0804190119?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Timothy Snyder</author></item><item><title>15: BLACK AF HISTORY</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780358439165.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A columnist at TheGrio.com articulates moments in American history that center the perspectives and experiences of Black Americans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;4 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Michael Harriot&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Dey Street</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0358439167?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0358439167?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Michael Harriot</author></item></channel></rss>